或\n产生的其他责任，不论是合同责任、侵权责任或其他责任\n来自、脱离或与软件相关的，或使用或\n软件的其他交易，即使被告知有这种可能性\n造成如此严重的损害。\n\n特此授予使用、复制、修改和分发\n本软件或其部分，不收取任何费用，\n须受以下限制：\n\n1.不得歪曲本软件的出处；您\n绝对不能声称原始软件是你写的。如果你\n在产品中使用此软件，在产品中确认\n如需相关文件，将不胜感激，但不是必需的。\n\n2.修改后的源版本必须明确标记，并且必须\n不会被错误地表述为原始软件。\n\n3.本版权声明不得从任何\n来源或更改的来源分布。', NULL);
INSERT INTO `license` VALUES (198, '2023-05-11 23:28:24', 'XSkat', 'XSkat License', 'https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing/XSkat_License', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 'This program is free software; you can redistribute it freely.\n\nUse it at your own risk; there is NO WARRANTY.\n\nRedistribution of modified versions is permitted provided that the following conditions are met:\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"1.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> All copyright & permission notices are preserved.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"2.a)\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Only changes required for packaging or porting are made.\n\n   or\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"2.b)\";match=\".{0,20}\">> It is clearly stated who last changed the program. The program is renamed or the version number is of the form x.y.z, where x.y is the version of the original program and z is an arbitrary suffix.', 'This program is free software; you can redistribute it freely.\nUse it at your own risk; there is NO WARRANTY.\n\nRedistribution of modified versions is permitted provided that the following conditions are met:\n\n1. All copyright & permission notices are preserved.\n\n2.a) Only changes required for packaging or porting are made.\n     or\n2.b) It is clearly stated who last changed the program. The program is renamed or the version number is of the form x.y.z, where x.y is the version of the original program and z is an arbitrary suffix.', '这个程序是自由软件，你可以免费再分发它。\n使用它的风险自负；没有保修。\n\n如果满足以下条件，则允许重新分发修改后的版本：\n\n1.所有版权和许可声明均予以保留。\n\n2.a)仅进行打包或移植所需的更改。\n或\n2.b)清楚地说明是谁最后更改了程序。程序被重命名或版本号的形式为x.y.z，其中x.y是原始程序的版本，z是任意后缀。', NULL);
