ctive Work\n\nYou agree to offer to the relevant third party making use of the Work (in either of the alternatives set out above) a licence to use the Derivative Work on any of the following premises:\n\n    * a licence to the Derivative Work on the same terms and conditions as the licence granted to You hereunder; or\n\n    * a later version of the licence granted to You hereunder; or\n\n    * any other Creative Commons licence with the same Licence Elements.\n\n2.4. This Licence does not affect any rights that the User may have under any applicable law, including fair use, fair dealing or any other legally recognised limitation or exception to copyright infringement.\n\n2.5. All rights not expressly granted by the Licensor are hereby reserved, including but not limited to, the exclusive right to collect, whether individually or via a licensing body, such as a collecting society, royalties for any use of the Work which results in commercial advantage or private monetary compensation.\n\n3. Warranties and Disclaimer\n\nExcept as required by law, the Work is licensed by the Licensor on an \"as is\" and \"as available\" basis and without any warranty of any kind, either express or implied.\n\n4. Limit of Liability\n\nSubject to any liability which may not be excluded or limited by law the Licensor shall not be liable and hereby expressly excludes all liability for loss or damage howsoever and whenever caused to You.\n\n5. Termination\n\nThe rights granted to You under this Licence shall terminate automatically upon any breach by You of the terms of this Licence. Individuals or entities who have received Collective Works from You under this Licence, however, will not have their Licences terminated provided such individuals or entities remain in full compliance with those Licences.\n\n6. General\n\n6.1. The validity or enforceability of the remaining terms of this agreement is not affected by the holding of any provision of it to be invalid or unenforceable.\n\n6.2. This Licence constitutes the entire Licence Agreement between the parties with respect to the Work licensed here. There are no understandings, agreements or representations with respect to the Work not specified here. The Licensor shall not be bound by any additional provisions that may appear in any communication in any form.\n\n6.3. A person who is not a party to this Licence shall have no rights under the Contracts (Rights of Third Parties) Act 1999 to enforce any of its terms.\n\n6.4. This Licence shall be governed by the law of England and Wales and the parties irrevocably submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the Courts of England and Wales.\n\n7. On the role of Creative Commons\n\n7.1. Neither the Licensor nor the User may use the Creative Commons logo except to indicate that the Work is licensed under a Creative Commons Licence. Any permitted use has to be in compliance with the Creative Commons trade mark usage guidelines at the time of use of the Creative Commons trade mark. These guidelines may be found on the Creative Commons website or be otherwise available upon request from time to time.\n\n7.2. Creative Commons Corporation does not profit financially from its role in providing this Licence and will not investigate the claims of any Licensor or user of the Licence.\n\n7.3. One of the conditions that Creative Commons Corporation requires of the Licensor and You is an acknowledgement of its limited role and agreement by all who use the Licence that the Corporation is not responsible to anyone for the statements and actions of You or the Licensor or anyone else attempting to use or using this Licence.\n\n7.4. Creative Commons Corporation is not a party to this Licence, and makes no warranty whatsoever in connection to the Work or in connection to the Licence, and in all events is not liable for any loss or damage resulting from the Licensor\'s or Your reliance on this Licence or on its enforceability.\n\n7.5. USE OF THIS LICENCE MEANS THAT YOU AND THE LICENSOR EACH ACCEPTS THESE CONDITIONS IN SECTION 7.1, 7.2, 7.3, 7.4 AND EACH ACKNOWLEDGES CREATIVE COMMONS CORPORATION\'S VERY LIMITED ROLE AS A FACILITATOR OF THE LICENCE FROM THE LICENSOR TO YOU.\n\nCreative Commons is not a party to this Licence, and makes no warranty whatsoever in connection with the Work. Creative Commons will not be liable to You or any party on any legal theory for any damages whatsoever, including without limitation any general, special, incidental or consequential damages arising in connection to this licence. Notwithstanding the foregoing two (2) sentences, if Creative Commons has expressly identified itself as the Licensor hereunder, it shall have all rights and obligations of Licensor.\n\nExcept for the limited purpose of indicating to the public that the Work is licensed under the CCPL, neither party will use the trademark \"Creative Commons\" or any related trademark or logo of Creative Commons without the prior written consent of Creative Commons. Any permitted use will be in compliance with Creative Commons\' then-current trademark usage guidelines, as may be published on its website or otherwise made available upon request from time to time.\n\nCreative Commons may be contacted at https://creativecommons.org/.', '知识共享署名-相似分享2.0英格兰和威尔士\n\nCreative Commons Corporation不是律师事务所，不提供法律服务。本许可证的分发不会造成律师与委托人之间的关系。知识共享在“原样”的基础上提供这些信息。Creative Commons对所提供的信息不作任何担保，也不对因使用该信息而造成的损害承担责任。\n\n牌照\n\n作品(定义如下)是根据本知识共享公共许可证(“CCPL”或“许可证”)的条款提供的。作品受著作权和/或其他适用法律保护。除本许可证或版权法授权外，禁止对作品的任何使用。您对此处提供的作品行使任何权利，即表示您接受并同意受本许可证条款的约束。许可方授予您此处所包含的权利，作为您接受此类条款和条件的代价。\n\n本知识共享英格兰和威尔士公共许可证允许您(以下定义的所有大写术语)根据本许可证的条款在全球范围内查看、编辑、修改、翻译和分发作品，前提是您认可原始作者。\n\n“许可方”[根据本许可证的条款和条件提供作品的一个或多个法律认可的个人或实体]\n\n和\n\n《你》\n\n同意如下：\n\n1.定义\n\n一个。“署名”是指承认在本许可证下对作品或集体作品作出贡献并对其拥有权利的所有各方。\n\nB.“集体作品”是指以未经修改的形式与若干其他独立的作品一起组成一个集体整体的作品。\n\nc.“衍生作品”是指通过在任何媒体上编辑、修改、改编或翻译作品而创作的任何作品(但是，就本许可证而言，构成集体作品的作品不被视为衍生作品)。为免生疑问，如作品是就本许可证而言，就音乐作品或声音记录而言，作品与运动图像的定时同步(“同步”)将被视为衍生作品。\n\nd.“许可”指英格兰和威尔士知识共享公共许可协议。\n\nE.“许可证要素”是指本许可证标题中标明的下列高级许可证属性：归属、类似共享。\n\nF.“原创作者”是指创作作品的个人(或实体)。\n\ng.“作品”指根据本许可证条款提供的受版权保护的作品。\n\nH.就本许可证而言，在与上下文不一致的情况下，单数中的单词包括复数。\n\n2.许可条款\n\n2.1许可方特此向您授予全球范围内的、免版税的、非排他性的使用许可，并在作品的版权期限内使用。\n\n您可以：\n\n*复制作品；\n\n*创作一件或多件衍生作品；\n\n*将作品并入一部或多部集体作品；\n\n*复制衍生作品或纳入任何集体作品的作品；及\n\n*以任何物质形式在任何媒体上向公众发布、分发、存档、表演或以其他方式传播作品或纳入任何集体作品的作品，无论是现在已知的还是以后创作的。\n\n然而，\n\n您不得：\n\n*对作品、衍生作品或纳入集体作品的作品的使用施加任何条款，以更改或限制本许可证的条款或根据本许可证授予的任何权利，或具有限制行使该等权利的能力的效果或意图；\n\n*将任何数字版权管理技术强加于作品或纳入集体作品的作品，以更改或限制本许可证的条款或根据本许可证授予的任何权利，或具有限制行使该等权利的能力的效果或意图；\n\n*对作品进行再许可；\n\n*以作品为主题O《1988年版权、外观设计和专利法》所界定的任何贬损待遇。\n\n最后，\n\n您必须：\n\n*在您出版、分发、表演或以其他方式传播或向公众提供的作品和集体作品的所有复制品上引用本许可证(通过统一资源标识符(URI)、口头或适用于所使用的媒体)；\n\n*承认许可人/原创作者对您出版、发行、表演或以其他方式向公众传播的任何作品和集体作品的归属权利，并确保您将所使用的媒体归功于许可人/原创作者；以及\n\n*在合理可行的范围内，保持所有提到本许可的通知，特别是许可方指定与作品相关的URI(如果有)，除非该URI没有提到作品的版权通知或许可信息。\n\n对使用该作品的第三方的附加规定\n\n2.2.许可方的进一步许可\n\n每次您发布、分发、表演或以其他方式传播\n\n*该作品；或\n\n*任何衍生作品；或\n\n*纳入集体作品的作品\n\n许可方同意向使用该作品的相关第三方(在上述任何替代方案中)提供许可，以按照本协议授予您的相同条款和条件使用该作品。\n\n2.3.你的进一步许可\n\n每次您发布、分发、表演或以其他方式传播\n\n*衍生作品；或\n\n*集合作品中包含的衍生作品\n\n您同意向使用该作品的相关第三方(在上述任一备选方案中)提供许可，以便在下列任何前提下使用该衍生作品：\n\n*衍生作品的特许，其条款及条件与根据本协议批予你的特许相同；或\n\n*根据本协议授予您的许可证的较新版本；或\n\n*a具有相同许可元素的NY其他知识共享许可。\n\n2.4.本许可证不影响用户根据任何适用法律可能享有的任何权利，包括公平使用、公平交易或任何其他法律承认的侵犯版权的限制或例外。\n\n2.5.特此保留许可方未明确授予的所有权利，包括但不限于，单独或通过许可机构(如收集协会)就作品的任何使用收取版税的独家权利，从而产生商业优势或私人金钱补偿。\n\n3.保证和免责声明\n\n除法律另有要求外，作品由许可方以“按原样”和“按可用”方式许可，不提供任何明示或默示的担保。\n\n4.法律责任限额\n\n受法律不能排除或限制的任何责任的约束，许可方不承担任何责任，特此明确排除对您造成的任何损失或损害的所有责任。\n\n5.终止合同\n\n在您违反本许可证条款时，根据本许可证授予您的权利将自动终止。然而，根据本许可证从您那里收到集体作品的个人或实体，其许可证不会被终止，前提是这些个人或实体仍完全遵守这些许可证。\n\n6.一般规定\n\n6.1.本协议其余条款的有效性或可执行性不受本协议中任何无效或不可执行的条款的影响。\n\n6.2.本许可构成双方之间关于在此许可的作品的完整许可协议。对于此处未指明的工作，不存在任何谅解、协议或陈述。许可方不受任何形式的通信中可能出现的任何附加条款的约束。\n\n6.3.非本许可证当事一方的人不享有合同(权利)项下的权利第三方)法案1999年，以执行其任何条款。\n\n6.4.本许可证受英格兰和威尔士法律管辖，双方不可撤销地服从英格兰和威尔士法院的专属管辖权。\n\n7.关于知识共享的作用\n\n7.1.许可方和用户均不得使用知识共享标志，除非表明作品是根据知识共享许可进行许可的。在使用Creative Commons商标时，任何允许的使用都必须符合Creative Commons商标使用指南。这些指南可以在知识共享网站上找到，也可以随时根据要求以其他方式获得。\n\n7.2.Creative Commons Corporation不会从其提供本许可证的角色中获利，也不会调查任何许可方或用户对许可证的索赔。\n\n7.3.Creative Commons Corporation对许可方和您要求的条件之一是承认其有限的作用，并由所有使用许可的人同意，该公司不对您或许可方或任何其他试图使用或使用本许可的任何人的声明和行为负责。\n\n7.4.Creative Commons Corporation不是本许可证的一方，对作品或与许可证相关的任何内容不作任何担保，在任何情况下，对许可方或您对本许可证或其可执行性的依赖所造成的任何损失或损害不承担任何责任。\n\n7.5。使用本许可意味着您和许可方各自接受第7.1、7.2、7.3、7.4节中的这些条件，并各自承认Creative Commons Corporation作为许可方向您提供许可的促进者的角色非常有限。\n\nCreative Commons不是本许可证的一方，也不对与作品相关的任何内容作出任何担保。知识共享将不对您或任何法律理论上的任何一方承担任何损害的责任，包括但不限于Y与本牌照有关而引起的一般、特殊、附带或后果性损害。尽管有上述两(2)句，但如果Creative Commons已明确表明自己是本协议项下的许可方，则它应享有许可方的所有权利和义务。\n\n除向公众表明作品在CCPL下获得许可的有限目的外，未经知识共享事先书面同意，任何一方均不得使用“知识共享”商标或知识共享的任何相关商标或标志。任何允许的使用都将遵守Creative Commons当时最新的商标使用指南，该指南可能会在其网站上发布，或应要求不时提供。\n\n可以在https://creativecommons.org/.上联系知识共享中心', NULL);
INSERT INTO `license` VALUES (250, '2023-05-11 23:28:24', 'BSD-2-Clause-Patent', 'BSD-2-Clause Plus Patent License', 'https://opensource.org/licenses/BSDplusPatent', 0, 0, 1, 0, NULL, '<<var;name=\"copyright\";original=\"Copyright (c) <YEAR> <COPYRIGHT HOLDERS>\";match=\".{0,1000}\">>\n\nRedistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without modification, are permitted provided that the following conditions are met:\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"1.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer.\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"2.\";match=\".{0,20}\">> Redistributions in binary form must reproduce the above copyright notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer in the documentation and/or other materials provided with the distribution.\n\nSubject to the terms and conditions of this license, each copyright holder and contributor hereby grants to those receiving rights under this license a perpetual, worldwide, non-exclusive, no-charge, royalty-free, irrevocable (except for failure to satisfy the conditions of this license) patent license to make, have made, use, offer to sell, sell, import, and otherwise transfer this software, where such license applies only to those patent claims, already acquired or hereafter acquired, licensable by such copyright holder or contributor that are necessarily infringed by:\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"(a)\";match=\".{0,20}\">> their Contribution(s) (the licensed copyrights of copyright holders and non-copyrightable additions of contributors, in source or binary form) alone; or\n\n   <<var;name=\"bullet\";original=\"(b)\";match=\".{0,20}\">> combination of their Contribution(s) with the work of authorship to which such Contribution(s) was added by such copyright holder or contributor, if, at the time the Contribution is added, such addition causes such combination to be necessarily infringed. The patent license shall not apply to any other combinations which include the Contribution.\n\nExcept as expressly stated above, no rights or licenses from any copyright holder or contributor is granted under this license, whether expressly, by implication, estoppel or otherwise.\n\nDISCLAIMER\n\nTHIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED BY THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND CONTRIBUTORS \"AS IS\" AND ANY EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE ARE DISCLAIMED. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS OR CONTRIBUTORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES (INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, PROCUREMENT OF SUBSTITUTE GOODS OR SERVICES; LOSS OF USE, DATA, OR PROFITS; OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION) HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON ANY THEORY OF LIABILITY, WHETHER IN CONTRACT, STRICT LIABILITY, OR TORT (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE OR OTHERWISE) ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE OF THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.', 'Copyright (c) <YEAR> <COPYRIGHT HOLDERS>\n\nRedistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without modification, are permitted provided that the following conditions are met:\n\n1. Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer.\n\n2. Redistributions in binary form must reproduce the above copyright notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer in the documentation and/or other materials provided with the distribution.\n\nSubject to the terms and conditions of this license, each copyright holder and contributor hereby grants to those receiving rights under this license a perpetual, worldwide, non-exclusive, no-charge, royalty-free, irrevocable (except for failure to satisfy the conditions of this license) patent license to make, have made, use, offer to sell, sell, import, and otherwise transfer this software, where such license applies only to those patent claims, already acquired or hereafter acquired, licensable by such copyright holder or contributor that are necessarily infringed by:\n\n(a) their Contribution(s) (the licensed copyrights of copyright holders and non-copyrightable additions of contributors, in source or binary form) alone; or\n\n(b) combination of their Contribution(s) with the work of authorship to which such Contribution(s) was added by such copyright holder or contributor, if, at the time the Contribution is added, such addition causes such combination to be necessarily infringed. The patent license shall not apply to any other combinations which include the Contribution.\n\nExcept as expressly stated above, no rights or licenses from any copyright holder or contributor is granted under this license, whether expressly, by implication, estoppel or otherwise.\n\nDISCLAIMER\n\nTHIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED BY THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND CONTRIBUTORS \"AS IS\" AND ANY EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE ARE DISCLAIMED. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS OR CONTRIBUTORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES (INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, PROCUREMENT OF SUBSTITUTE GOODS OR SERVICES; LOSS OF USE, DATA, OR PROFITS; OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION) HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON ANY THEORY OF LIABILITY, WHETHER IN CONTRACT, STRICT LIABILITY, OR TORT (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE OR OTHERWISE) ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE OF THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.', '版权(C)<年份><版权所有者>\n\n在满足以下条件的情况下，允许以源代码和二进制形式重新分发和使用，无论是否进行修改：\n\n1.源代码的再分发必须保留上述版权声明、此条件列表和以下免责声明。\n\n2.二进制形式的再分发必须在随分发提供的文档和/或其他材料中复制上述版权声明、此条件列表和以下免责声明。\n\n根据本许可证的条款和条件，每个版权所有者和贡献者特此向根据本许可证获得权利的人授予永久的、全球范围的、非排他性的、免费的、免版税的、不可撤销的(除非未能满足本许可证的条件)专利许可证，以制造、制造、使用、要约出售、出售、进口和以其他方式转让本软件，如果该许可证仅适用于该版权所有者或贡献者已经获得或以后获得的、可由该版权所有者或贡献者许可的、必然受到下列侵犯的专利主张：\n\n(A)仅其投稿(S)(著作权人的许可著作权和投稿人以源代码或二进制形式的不可著作权的添加)；或\n\n(B)他们的投稿(S)与该著作权人或投稿人添加了该投稿的作者作品(S)的组合，如果在添加该投稿时，这种添加必然会导致这种组合受到侵犯。专利许可不适用于包括该贡献的任何其他组合。\n\n除上述明确声明外，任何版权所有者或贡献者在本许可证下均未授予任何权利或许可，无论是明示、暗示、禁止反言或其他方式。\n\n免责声明\n\n本软件由版权所有者和贡献者按原样提供，并提供任何明示或默示保证，包括但不限于对适销性的默示保证。和对某一特定目的的适合性被否认。在任何情况下，版权所有者或贡献者均不对因使用本软件而造成的任何直接、间接、附带、特殊、惩罚性或后果性损害(包括但不限于购买替代产品或服务；失去使用、数据或利润；或业务中断)承担责任，即使被告知此类损害的可能性已被告知，也不承担任何责任理论，无论是合同责任、严格责任或侵权(包括疏忽或其他)。', 'Note: This license is designed to provide: a) a simple permissive license; b) that is compatible with the GNU General Public License (GPL), version 2; and c) which also has an express patent grant included.');